              "text": "Sohag"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000006",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " is characterized by its division into distinct areas, each with its unique charm and offerings. The city is relatively compact, making it feasible to explore on foot or by local transportation. Key areas include the city center, which houses markets, museums, and historical sites, and the outskirts, where you can find ancient ruins and traditional villages."
