                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Local Buses and Mini-Buses:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "00000000000d",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " These are the most economical way to travel around Sohag. They cover extensive parts of the city and surrounding areas. For deeper insights, engage with locals on these rides; it’s a chance to learn the ins and outs of Sohag from those who know it best."
            }
          ],
