              "_key": "00000000000f",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [
                "strong"
              ],
              "text": "Taxis:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000010",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " More comfortable but costlier than buses, taxis can be hailed on the street or booked via phone. Negotiating the fare in advance is a savvy move to avoid surprises."
