              ],
              "text": "Navigating Insights:"
            },
            {
              "_key": "000000000018",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": " Understanding and respecting local customs is key to a smooth experience in Sohag. Dress modestly, especially when visiting religious sites or traditional villages. Learning a few basic Arabic phrases can go a long way in showing respect and opening doors to more authentic interactions."
            }
